    "page_title": "Limits, quotas & errors",
    "short_description": "Standard-tier limits, quotas, pagination envelope, and the v3 API's error response shape.",
    "body": "<h1>Limits, quotas &amp; errors {{ds:component/chip|label=v3|variant=success}}</h1>

<p><strong>v3 is the current API version.</strong> <a href={{cms:item/c4bc7f8a-2c8b-40b4-a6ee-26337df01765}}>v2 docs remain available</a> for users still on the previous version.</p>

<h2 id=rate-limits>Rate limits</h2>
<p>Standard-tier accounts are rate-limited to <strong>1,000 requests per minute</strong> per workspace. The remaining quota is returned in the <code>X-RateLimit-Remaining</code> response header.</p>

<h2 id=pagination>Pagination</h2>
<p>All list endpoints use cursor-based pagination. Responses include:</p>

{{ds:component/code-block|language=json|code={
  "items": [...],
  "pagination": {
    "next_cursor": "abc123def456",
    "has_more": true
  }
}}}

<p>Pass the <code>next_cursor</code> to the <code>cursor</code> query parameter to fetch the next page. The <code>page_size</code> parameter (1–100, defaults to 20) controls results per page.</p>

<h2 id=error-responses>Error responses</h2>
<p>Errors are returned with a non-2xx status and include:</p>

{{ds:component/code-block|language=json|code={
  "error": {
    "code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
    "message": "Request failed validation",
    "details": {
      "fields": {
        "name": "Pipeline name is required"
      }
    }
  }
}}}

<p>Common error codes:</p>
<ul>
  <li><code>VALIDATION_ERROR</code> (400) — Request body failed validation</li>
  <li><code>NOT_FOUND</code> (404) — Resource does not exist</li>
  <li><code>CONFLICT</code> (409) — Resource already exists (e.g., duplicate pipeline name)</li>
  <li><code>RATE_LIMITED</code> (429) — Rate limit exceeded; retry after the <code>Retry-After</code> header</li>
  <li><code>INTERNAL_ERROR</code> (500) — Unexpected server error</li>
</ul>

{{ds:component/docs-toc|items_html=<li><a href=#rate-limits>Rate limits</a></li><li><a href=#pagination>Pagination</a></li><li><a href=#error-responses>Error responses</a></li>}}",
